---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import App from '../App'
---

<Layout
  title="DAP Web — Runner, Live Debugger & Analyzer untuk Pseudocode DAP"
  description="Jalankan, debug langkah demi langkah, dan analisis kode pseudocode DAP langsung di browser tanpa instalasi. Dilengkapi terminal interaktif, visualisasi Heap & Pointer (Linked List/Stack), Token, AST, dan Bytecode VM."
>
  <!-- Interactive Workspace: Full viewport on desktop, natural unclipped stack on mobile -->
  <div class="w-full lg:h-screen lg:overflow-hidden">
    <App client:only="react" />
    <noscript>
      <div class="flex min-h-screen items-center justify-center bg-[#F6F9FC] p-6 text-center text-[#0A2540]">
        <div class="max-w-md rounded-md border border-[#E3E8EE] bg-white p-6">
          <h1 class="text-lg font-semibold">DAP Web</h1>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#425466]">
            Aktifkan JavaScript dan WebAssembly pada browser Anda untuk menjalankan editor, debugger,
            dan analyzer pseudocode DAP.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </noscript>
  </div>

  <!-- Editorial Documentation & SEO Section — Stripe architectural vertical hairline grid -->
  <section
    id="about-dap-web"
    aria-label="Dokumentasi singkat dan spesifikasi DAP Web"
    class="border-t border-[#E3E8EE] bg-white text-[#0A2540] dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-[#0A2540] dark:text-white"
  >
    <div class="stripe-guides mx-auto max-w-6xl border-x border-[#E3E8EE] px-6 py-16 sm:px-10 lg:py-24 dark:border-white/10">
      <!-- Asymmetric Editorial Lead -->
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-start">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <h1 class="text-3xl font-medium tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#0A2540] sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">
            Jalankan, debug, dan bedah pseudocode DAP langsung di browser.
          </h1>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#425466] dark:text-[#ADBDCC]">
            <strong>DAP Web</strong> menjalankan engine asli dari{' '}
            <a
              href="https://github.com/rafiathallah3/dap"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="font-medium text-[#635BFF] hover:underline dark:text-[#80E9FF]"
            >
              rafiathallah3/dap
            </a>{' '}
            secara native di sisi klien tanpa server maupun instalasi CLI. Dirancang untuk mempermudah
            praktikum algoritma, penelusuran loop langkah demi langkah, serta inspeksi pointer dan memori dinamis.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stripe-style Left-Accented Architectural Feature Rows (NO rounded bento cards) -->
      <div class="mt-16 grid gap-x-8 gap-y-10 border-t border-[#E3E8EE] pt-12 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 dark:border-white/10">
        <article class="border-l border-[#635BFF] pl-4">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white">
            Engine asli tanpa kompromi
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#425466] dark:text-[#ADBDCC]">
            Lexer, parser, tree-walking interpreter, dan bytecode VM dikompilasi langsung dari source Go DAP agar
            hasil eksekusi identik dengan CLI.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="border-l border-[#635BFF] pl-4">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white">
            Step debugger per iterasi
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#425466] dark:text-[#ADBDCC]">
            Pasang breakpoint di gutter, telusuri <code>for</code>/<code>while</code>/<code>repeat</code> tiap
            iterasi, periksa Call Stack, dan pantau perubahan variabel secara langsung.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="border-l border-[#635BFF] pl-4">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white">
            Inspeksi Heap &amp; Pointer
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#425466] dark:text-[#ADBDCC]">
            Lihat alamat <code>0x1000</code>, status <code>ALLOCATED</code> dan <code>FREED</code>, serta tautan
            field struct saat menjalankan Singly/Doubly Linked List atau Stack.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="border-l border-[#635BFF] pl-4">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white">
            Tokens, AST &amp; Bytecode
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#425466] dark:text-[#ADBDCC]">
            Telusuri token dengan navigasi klik-ke-baris, baca AST dalam bentuk tree interaktif, ASCII, atau JSON,
            dan ikuti operand stack pada mode Bytecode VM.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- Technical Syntax Reference Table -->
      <div class="mt-20 grid gap-8 border-t border-[#E3E8EE] pt-12 lg:grid-cols-12 dark:border-white/10">
        <div class="lg:col-span-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white">
            Referensi cepat sintaks DAP
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#425466] dark:text-[#ADBDCC]">
            Editor menyediakan autocomplete kontekstual dan snippet (<code>Ctrl + Space</code>), multi-tab file,
            serta penyimpanan otomatis di <code>localStorage</code>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto lg:col-span-8">
          <table class="w-full border-collapse text-left text-[13px]">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-[#E3E8EE] text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#697386] dark:border-white/10 dark:text-[#7C93AB]">
                <th class="py-2.5 pr-4">Struktur</th>
                <th class="py-2.5">Sintaks</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-[#E3E8EE] dark:divide-white/10">
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 font-medium text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white">Kerangka Program</td>
                <td class="py-3 font-mono text-xs text-[#425466] dark:text-[#ADBDCC]">
                  program Nama ... dictionary/kamus ... algorithm/algoritma ... endprogram
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 font-medium text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white">Input &amp; Output</td>
                <td class="py-3 font-mono text-xs text-[#425466] dark:text-[#ADBDCC]">
                  read x, input(x), inputBaris(nama), print x, output(x), write x
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 font-medium text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white">Percabangan</td>
                <td class="py-3 font-mono text-xs text-[#425466] dark:text-[#ADBDCC]">
                  if ... then ... elif ... else ... endif &nbsp;|&nbsp; depend on ... default : ... enddependon
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 font-medium text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white">Perulangan</td>
                <td class="py-3 font-mono text-xs text-[#425466] dark:text-[#ADBDCC]">
                  for i = 1 to N do ... endfor &nbsp;|&nbsp; while ... do ... endwhile &nbsp;|&nbsp; repeat ... until
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 font-medium text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white">Pointer &amp; Heap</td>
                <td class="py-3 font-mono text-xs text-[#425466] dark:text-[#ADBDCC]">
                  pointer to ElmList, allocate(P), P-&gt;info &lt;- 10, deallocate(P), nil
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Hairline Editorial FAQ -->
      <div class="mt-20 grid gap-8 border-t border-[#E3E8EE] pt-12 lg:grid-cols-12 dark:border-white/10">
        <div class="lg:col-span-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white">
            Pertanyaan umum
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="divide-y divide-[#E3E8EE] border-y border-[#E3E8EE] lg:col-span-8 dark:divide-white/10 dark:border-white/10">
          <details class="group py-4">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between text-sm font-medium text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white">
              <span>Apakah perlu instalasi CLI atau Docker?</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[#697386] transition group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-2.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#425466] dark:text-[#ADBDCC]">
              Tidak. Engine DAP berjalan langsung di browser melalui Web Worker terisolasi tanpa memerlukan server
              eksekusi, Docker, maupun Podman.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details class="group py-4">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between text-sm font-medium text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white">
              <span>Apakah file tetap tersimpan jika browser ditutup?</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[#697386] transition group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-2.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#425466] dark:text-[#ADBDCC]">
              Ya. Semua tab file, nama file, isi kode, breakpoint, dan input otomatis disimpan ke
              <code>localStorage</code> browser dan dapat diekspor sebagai file <code>.dap</code> kapan saja.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details class="group py-4">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between text-sm font-medium text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white">
              <span>Di mana kode sumber dan dokumentasi lengkapnya?</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[#697386] transition group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-2.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#425466] dark:text-[#ADBDCC]">
              Antarmuka web berada di{' '}
              <a
                href="https://github.com/mee-i/dap-web"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noreferrer"
                class="font-medium text-[#635BFF] hover:underline dark:text-[#80E9FF]"
              >
                github.com/mee-i/dap-web
              </a>
              , engine bahasa dari{' '}
              <a
                href="https://github.com/rafiathallah3/dap"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noreferrer"
                class="font-medium text-[#635BFF] hover:underline dark:text-[#80E9FF]"
              >
                github.com/rafiathallah3/dap
              </a>
              , dan dokumentasi resmi di{' '}
              <a
                href="https://rafiathallah3.github.io/dap/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noreferrer"
                class="font-medium text-[#635BFF] hover:underline dark:text-[#80E9FF]"
              >
                rafiathallah3.github.io/dap
              </a>
              .
            </p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stripe Deep Navy Bottom Band -->
  <div class="border-t border-white/10 bg-[#0A2540] px-6 py-8 text-xs text-[#ADBDCC]">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 sm:px-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">dap</span>
        <span class="text-white/25">/</span>
        <span>Web environment untuk bahasa pseudocode DAP</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">
        <a href="https://github.com/mee-i/dap-web" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="hover:text-white">
          mee-i/dap-web
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/rafiathallah3/dap" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="hover:text-white">
          rafiathallah3/dap
        </a>
        <a href="https://rafiathallah3.github.io/dap/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="hover:text-white">
          Dokumentasi
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
